---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Disclaimer — KDS Airdrop Hub"
  description="Read the KDS Airdrop Hub disclaimer covering educational content, crypto risks, and responsibility when using external projects."
  canonical="https://airdrop-hub.cryptoatlas.workers.dev/disclaimer"
>
  <main>
    <section class="article">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="article-header">
          <span class="coming-soon-badge">Disclaimer</span>
          <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
          <p class="article-meta">
            KDS Airdrop Hub · Reviewed for the 2026 season
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="article-body">
          <h2>Educational Content Only</h2>
          <p>
            The information published on KDS Airdrop Hub is provided for
            general educational and informational purposes only.
          </p>

          <p>
            Nothing on this website constitutes financial, investment,
            trading, tax, legal, or other professional advice.
          </p>

          <h2>No Guarantee of Rewards</h2>
          <p>
            Participation in an airdrop, testnet, faucet, quest, or other
            crypto activity does not guarantee that a visitor will receive
            tokens or other rewards.
          </p>

          <p>
            Eligibility rules, reward structures, campaign availability, and
            project conditions can change without notice.
          </p>

          <h2>Crypto Risks</h2>
          <p>
            Interacting with blockchain networks and crypto applications can
            involve financial, technical, security, and other risks.
          </p>

          <p>
            Users are responsible for evaluating those risks and deciding
            whether an activity is appropriate for them.
          </p>

          <h2>External Links and Projects</h2>
          <p>
            KDS Airdrop Hub may reference external websites, applications,
            protocols, wallets, or crypto projects. We do not control those
            external services and cannot guarantee their security,
            availability, accuracy, or future behavior.
          </p>

          <h2>Do Your Own Research</h2>
          <p>
            Always verify a project's official website and communication
            channels before connecting a wallet, signing a transaction, or
            providing any information.
          </p>

          <p>
            Never share a seed phrase or private key with anyone, including
            someone claiming to represent a crypto project or KDS Airdrop
            Hub.
          </p>

          <h2>Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
          <p>
            By using information from this website, you acknowledge that you
            are responsible for your own decisions and actions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
